. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H2 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * We construct "left" from plh0004 as our measure of of political att
> itudes(hypothesis 2), 
.         * If left is greater, the respondent is states to have a more left-le
> aning political attitude.
.         * We run an IV regression analysis with left as dependent variable an
> d the first daughter as an instrument for 
.         * the dummy variable d_daughter, along with other control variables.
. 
. *We only run this analysis to get the degrees of freedom        
. ivregress 2sls  left (d_daughter=firstdaughter) age kid1age sex germborn i.ed
